<title>UK: UK expects gilt strips market to start in Autumn.</title>
<headline>UK expects gilt strips market to start in Autumn.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Treasury said on Wednesday that its planned gilt strips market is expected to start during the Autumn of 1997.</p>
<p>It said it intends all of next year's issues of conventional benchmark stocks will be strippable and further offers for conversion of existing unstrippable stocks are likely.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
